; Find the record of the location of the current actor
;
; Takes the first location (+$10) of the actor record at (#R$B70C) and looks up
; the location record.
;
; O:IX Record of the actor's location (#R$9BB1: unchanged when the id is not a location)
@label=GetActorLocationRec
c$9D37 PUSH AF
 $9D38 LD IX,($B70C)
 $9D3C LD A,(IX+$10)
 $9D3F CALL $9BB1
 $9D42 POP AF
 $9D43 RET
